koz Benchmark : global variables. 80 000 reads and writes of a global, one condition per step finkoz

keksoz total idon 0

zafer cumul(k)
ouver
    kan k piti 1 ouver ran total fèrm
    total idon total èk 1
    ran cumul(k mwin 1)
fèrm

zafer repete(r)
ouver
    kan r piti 1 ouver ran 0 fèrm
